  MergingAggregated
    GatherExchange
      Aggregating
        Expression (Before GROUP BY)
          JoinLogical (Broadcast HashJoin )
            Expression (Change column names to column identifiers)
              ReadFromMergeTree (ParallelRead default.t_layout_zone_left)
            Expression (Change column names to column identifiers)
              ReadFromMergeTree (ReplicatedRead default.t_layout_zone_right)
